                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}",
                  "description": "A DIFFERENT user's id (copy one from \"All users\"'s response) - not your own. An admin can't change their own role, so calling this on yourself returns 400."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin-only (Moderators get 403 - see RolesGuard/@Roles('ADMIN')). Body is { \"role\": \"ADMIN\" | \"MODERATOR\" | \"NONE\" } - 'NONE' revokes admin access entirely (isAdmin=false, role=null). Sets isAdmin and role together, so they never drift out of sync.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"MODERATOR\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
